  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Alpha. No change to the library: this release carries the same assemblies as 0.0.0-alpha.5 and exists because the macOS arm64 lane is now green, which makes the compatibility claim proven on both supported platforms rather than one. The two failures there were pane width, not tmux behaviour: a wide prompt wraps typed text and tmux stores the wrap as a line break. The public API is not settled and may change without notice between prereleases; pin an exact version. Full history: https://github.com/libtmux/libtmux-dotnet/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
